<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank to hold news conference on July 10.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank to hold news conference on July 10.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said on Monday it will hold a news conference on July 10 at 1015 GMT in Aschau, Bavaria, after its regular annual out-of-town policy-making council meeting.</p>
<p>As a rule the central bank holds a news conference after its traditional meeting outside Frankfurt.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
